---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MiniAvatar from '../components/MiniAvatar.astro';
---
<Layout title="Language World | Mini’s World" activeNav="language" description="Learn 10,000 Chinese and 10,000 Spanish words with Mini through quick lessons, spaced reviews, English meanings and a pixel progress trail.">
 <a class="back-link game-collection-back" href="/game">← All games</a>
 <header class="language-hero"><div><span class="case-study-kicker">MINI’S LANGUAGE WORLD</span><h1>Little words.<br/>A bigger world.</h1><p>Learn Chinese and Spanish with Mini. Read, listen, and practice a little every day.</p><nav class="language-course-tabs" aria-label="Choose a language"><button data-language-course="zh" aria-pressed="true">中文 Chinese <small>10,000 entries</small></button><button data-language-course="es" aria-pressed="false">Hola Spanish <small>10,000 words</small></button></nav></div><div class="language-mini"><span>Let’s learn together! ♡</span><MiniAvatar variant="language" controlledPose="study" /></div></header>
 <section class="language-account" aria-label="Your player account"><div><strong id="language-player">Guest learner</strong><p id="language-account-status">You can learn now. Progress is saved in this browser.</p></div><div><button id="language-login" type="button">Sign in with Google</button><button id="language-logout" type="button" hidden>Sign out</button></div><p id="language-save-status" role="status">Saved in this browser.</p></section>
 <div class="language-stats" aria-label="Learning progress"><span><strong id="language-level">1</strong> learner level</span><span><strong id="language-xp">0</strong> learning XP</span><span><strong id="language-familiar">0</strong> familiar words</span><span><strong id="language-days">0</strong> study days</span><a href="/game/mini-world">Dress Mini & play →</a></div>
 <section class="language-overall-progress" aria-label="Vocabulary progress"><div><span class="case-study-kicker">MINI’S WORD TRAIL</span><strong id="language-progress-title">0 of 10,000 words explored</strong><small id="language-progress-detail">Keep going, one little word at a time.</small></div><progress id="language-progress" max="10000" value="0" aria-label="Words explored"></progress><p id="language-level-progress">0 / 100 XP to level 2</p><progress id="language-xp-progress" max="100" value="0" aria-label="XP toward the next learner level"></progress></section>
 <section class="language-path" aria-labelledby="language-path-title"><header><div><span class="case-study-kicker">ONE SMALL LESSON AT A TIME</span><h2 id="language-path-title">Your Chinese path</h2></div><div class="language-path-actions"><button id="language-continue">Learn next 10 words →</button><button id="language-test-out" type="button">Test out of this unit ✦</button><button id="language-review">Review due words ↻</button></div></header><p id="language-path-note">Follow Mini’s trail from your current unit. Pass a 10-question challenge to unlock the next one.</p><div class="language-trail-status" id="language-trail-status" role="status"></div><div id="language-units" class="language-units"></div><details class="language-past-units"><summary>Already learned <span id="language-completed-count">0 units</span> <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary><div id="language-completed-units" class="language-completed-units"></div></details><details class="language-jump"><summary>Explore any unit</summary><div class="language-page-controls"><label>Jump to unit <input id="unit-jump" type="number" min="1" max="500" value="1"/></label><button id="unit-go">Open unit</button></div><p>You can practice any unit whenever you like. Your main trail stays on the next unfinished unit.</p></details></section>
 <section class="language-play" aria-labelledby="language-play-title"><header><div><span class="case-study-kicker">A LITTLE GAME WITH MINI</span><h2 id="language-play-title">Word match</h2><p>Pair words with their English meanings. Choose words from anywhere in the garden, outside the unit path.</p></div><button id="match-start" type="button">Play 5 pairs →</button></header><div id="match-game" class="match-game" hidden><p id="match-progress" role="status"></p><div id="match-words" class="match-column" aria-label="Words"></div><div id="match-meanings" class="match-column" aria-label="English meanings"></div><p id="match-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="match-again" type="button" hidden>Play another round →</button></div></section>
 <section class="language-recent" aria-labelledby="language-recent-title"><header><div><span class="case-study-kicker">YOUR LAST STEPS</span><h2 id="language-recent-title">Recently learned</h2></div><span id="language-recent-count"></span></header><div id="language-recent-words" class="language-recent-words"></div></section>
 <section class="language-lesson" id="language-lesson" hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-title" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><div class="language-activity-panel"><header><h2 id="lesson-title">A little lesson</h2><button id="lesson-close" aria-label="Close lesson">×</button></header><progress id="lesson-progress" max="10" value="0" aria-label="Lesson progress"></progress><p id="lesson-position"></p><div id="lesson-card"><p id="lesson-instruction"></p><div id="lesson-word" class="language-word"></div><p id="lesson-pinyin"></p><button id="lesson-listen" type="button">♫ Listen</button><p id="lesson-meaning"></p><button id="lesson-reveal" type="button">Peek at English meaning</button><div id="lesson-answers" class="lesson-answers"></div></div><p id="lesson-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="lesson-next">Next word →</button><button id="lesson-continue" hidden>Keep learning · next 10 →</button><p id="lesson-audio-status" class="language-note" role="status"></p></div></section>
 <section class="language-exam" id="language-exam" hidden aria-labelledby="exam-title" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><div class="language-activity-panel"><header><div><span class="case-study-kicker">UNIT CHALLENGE</span><h2 id="exam-title">Test out</h2></div><button id="exam-close" type="button" aria-label="Close unit challenge">×</button></header><progress id="exam-progress" max="10" value="0" aria-label="Challenge progress"></progress><p id="exam-position"></p><div id="exam-card"><p>Choose the English meaning. No hints this time!</p><div id="exam-word" class="language-word"></div><div id="exam-answers" class="lesson-answers"></div></div><p id="exam-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="exam-next" type="button" hidden>Next question →</button><div id="exam-result" hidden><p id="exam-result-text"></p><button id="exam-retry" type="button">Try again ↻</button><button id="exam-learn" type="button">Practice this unit →</button><button id="exam-done" type="button">Back to path →</button></div></div></section>
 <section class="language-dictionary" aria-labelledby="language-dictionary-title"><details><summary><span><span class="case-study-kicker">YOUR WORD GARDEN</span><h2 id="language-dictionary-title">Explore 10,000 entries</h2></span><span class="language-dictionary-toggle">Browse words <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></span></summary><div class="language-dictionary-content"><header><p>Search the full collection whenever you want a particular word.</p><a id="language-download" href="/languages/chinese.json" download>Download vocabulary ↓</a></header><label for="language-search">Find a word, its pronunciation, or an English meaning</label><input id="language-search" type="search" placeholder="Try 你好, ni3 hao3, or hello" autocomplete="off"/><label class="language-known-filter"><input id="language-known" type="checkbox"/>Show only familiar words</label><p id="dictionary-status" role="status">Loading vocabulary…</p><div id="language-words" class="language-words"></div><nav class="language-page-controls" aria-label="Vocabulary pages"><button id="words-prev">← Previous</button><span id="words-page"></span><button id="words-next">Next →</button></nav></div></details></section>
 <aside class="language-sources"><h2>About this word garden</h2><p>This is Mini’s original learning experience. Chinese entries come from <a href="https://www.mdbg.net/chinese/dictionary?page=cc-cedict" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC-CEDICT</a> under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. Spanish entries include Mini’s original beginner list and selections from <a href="https://www.wikdict.com/page/download" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WikDict’s Spanish–English dictionary</a>, based on Wiktionary via DBnary and licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>. We selected and reordered 10,000 unique entries for each language. This is not an official Duolingo course.</p><p>Three successful recall levels mark a word as familiar. Due words return gradually while new words stay available. Pronunciation uses available device voices. <a href="/languages/NOTICE.txt">Dataset attribution & changes →</a></p></aside>
 <script>import { initLanguage } from '../lib/min-language.js';initLanguage();</script>
</Layout>
